        "settings.widgetsFoot": "To add a widget, touch and hold an empty space on your home screen, tap Widgets, then find Prayer Times Asia.",
        "settings.seeWidgets": "See the widgets",
        "settings.accuracyPhone": "Every day shows its source grade. A is official, B is confirmed by a masjid, C is checked by the community, D is worked out on your phone. F (falak) marks a reading from your own shadow stick, which only checks the times. In Singapore, Malaysia and Indonesia the app downloads the official MUIS, JAKIM or Kemenag timetable for the year and keeps it on your phone for offline use. Only the year, zone code or area name is sent. Everywhere else, and before that download, times are worked out on your phone with the country's own method. That working is checked against every day of the 2026 MUIS, JAKIM and Kemenag timetables. For Singapore it is never earlier than the official time, and at most 2 minutes later. For Malaysia and Indonesia it is within about 2 minutes.",
        "settings.followsPhone": "The app follows your phone's language.",
        "settings.samePhone": "Same as your phone",
        "settings.namesFootPhone": "Pick Malay for Subuh and Isyak. When you travel, the local name shows small beside it, so the masjid's signs make sense.",
        "settings.pretendFoot": "Shows a pretend Ramadan or Eid date so you can try it early.",
        "settings.pretendOnFoot": "Pretend mode is on. The app shows a pretend date, not today's. Turn it off before you rely on the times.",
        "settings.trackerFootPhone": "Tick off each prayer on the Prayer screen once it has passed, and keep a streak. Tap the streak to mark a day as excused, like haid or illness, so it carries on. Kept only on this phone.",
        "settings.trackerNudgeNote": "The nudge before time runs out is in Alerts and alarms.",
        "settings.movingFootPhone": "A QR code or link carries your places, choices and tracker. No account and nothing uploaded. Works with Android, iPhone and the web. Setting up a new Android phone from your Google backup brings them too.",
